    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You naturally know how to avoid attacks and defend your mind and body when <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> is with you.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> Cannot be a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> On your turn, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a>, you can spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to increase all of your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a> by 2 until the start of your next turn.</p>",
